  <programme start="20261025120500 +0000" stop="20261025130500 +0000" channel="unknown.unifitv">
    <title lang="en">Sinister Beings 2</title>
    <desc lang="en">Television station owner Zhou Yaqiang, seeking to prolong his fortune through sorcery, hires the sorcerer Jiang Tianji to move his great-grandfather's grave, but is refused. It turns out that Tianji's father was killed by his great-grandfather, who had transformed into a zombie. Yaqiang sends his henchmen, Fly and Creamy Pig, to force Tianji to comply. Tianji discovers Fly has been taken away by the female ghost Mingtian and rushes to her rescue. Mingtian confesses to being killed by the sorcerer Gao Shanbao, only asking Fly to retrieve her ashes. Tianji, suspecting a trap, tries to subdue Mingtian, but Fly stops him. Yaqiang hires Shanbao to move the grave, but the great-grandfather transforms into a zombie, and Yaqiang is injured and becomes half-human, half-zombie. The television station becomes a zombie-infested area. Tianji, along with his apprentice Lingxin and Fly, arrive and ultimately defeat the zombies. Fly also retrieves Mingtian's ashes and marries her in a ghost marriage.</desc>
    <category lang="en">Drama Series</category>
    <episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.26.</episode-num>
    <episode-num system="onscreen">S1E27</episode-num>
